ABOUT
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Beverage industry journalist with eight years covering the US craft beer
sector. Senior reporter at Craft Brew Monthly since 2022. Previous bylines
in Brewing News Quarterly and Southern Beverage Review. Focus areas include
production scaling, regional distribution, family-owned breweries, and
competition coverage (GABF, World Beer Cup).

